IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ea-cpc-interface`
IMPORT `ea-types`
IMPORT `ea-records-opinion-character`

-- Tests for ea-records-opinion-character.l4 (Evidence Act 1893, ss 34 to 57).
-- Expected values are read off the Act's text and illustrations.  Generated by generators/ea_tests_2.py.

§ `34 to 41. Records`

`s34 ill the account books` MEANS `Record Facts` WITH
    `the entry is in books of accounts regularly kept in the course of business` IS TRUE
    `the entry refers to a matter into which the court has to inquire` IS TRUE
    `there is other evidence to charge the person with liability` IS FALSE
    `the entry is in a public or other official book, register or record` IS FALSE
    `the entry states a fact in issue or a relevant fact` IS FALSE
    `the entry was made by a public officer in the discharge of official duty, or by another person in performance of a duty specially enjoined by the law of the country in which the book, register or record is kept` IS FALSE
    `the statement is made in a published map or chart generally offered for public sale` IS FALSE
    `the statement is made in a map or plan made under the authority of the Government as to matters usually represented or stated in such maps or plans` IS FALSE
    `the court has to form an opinion as to the existence of a fact of a public nature` IS FALSE
    `the statement is made in a recital in an Act or Ordinance` IS FALSE
    `the statement is made in a recital in legislation enacted by the Parliament of Malaysia or the legislature of a part of the Commonwealth` IS FALSE
    `the statement is made in a recital in legislation enacted by the legislature of a State of Malaysia` IS FALSE
    `the statement is made in a recital in a document purporting to be the Government Gazette, the London Gazette, or a Gazette of Malaysia or of a part of the Commonwealth` IS FALSE
    `the court has to form an opinion as to a law of a country` IS FALSE
    `the statement is contained in a book purporting to be printed or published under the authority of the government of that country and to contain that law` IS FALSE
    `the report is of a ruling of the courts of that country and is contained in a book purporting to be a report of the rulings` IS FALSE
    `the statement forms part of a longer statement, a conversation, an isolated document, or a document forming part of a book or of a connected series of letters or papers` IS FALSE
    `the court considers the whole of it necessary in that particular case to the full understanding of the nature and effect of the statement and of the circumstances in which it was made` IS FALSE

